id=vintf_sysvipc
name=VINTF SYSVIPC compat (Droidspaces)
version=v1.0
versionCode=1
author=minghao680
description=Allows CONFIG_SYSVIPC=y kernels to pass the VINTF kernel-config check, removing the boot "device internal problem" dialog. Files under system/etc/vintf are overlaid by KernelSU; real /system is untouched.
